  "details": "The position of the game object placed directly under the avatar will gradually shift as you walk around the world.  In particular, it is easy to shift if you take a walk while looking in the direction directly above or below.  This has happened since the update around June this year.  You can take measures by using Constraint, but before, the position did not shift even without Constraint, so the difference is worrisome.",
